Tech Stack

* n8n — Workflow orchestration
* OpenAI — Lead analysis and classification
* Telegram Bot API — Customer message source
* Google Sheets — Lightweight CRM database
* JavaScript — AI response parsing and validation

⸻

Outcome

Deliverable 6 successfully demonstrates an AI-powered CRM pipeline capable of:

Receiving → Analyzing → Validating → Identifying → Creating/Updating → Routing

customer leads automatically.

The system prevents duplicate records by identifying Telegram users through their unique User ID and updating existing CRM entries as new interactions occur.

This project serves as the CRM/state-management foundation for more advanced automations such as automated follow-up systems, appointment booking, conversational agents, and full lead-to-appointment workflows.
